@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180/api/clients
# Después de crear un cliente, copia aquí el id que devuelve la respuesta
@clientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ───────────── Peticiones exitosas ─────────────

### Registrar un cliente (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CitizenshipCard",
  "documentNumber": "1037654321",
  "firstName": "Laura",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "email": "laura.gomez@correo.com",
  "phone": "300 123 4567",
  "birthDate": "2000-05-14",
  "emergencyContactName": "Ana Gómez",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "310-555-1234"
}

### Listar clientes paginados (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Buscar por nombre, documento o correo y filtrar por estado (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=gomez&status=Active

### Consultar el detalle de un cliente (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{clientId}}

### Actualizar un cliente (204 No Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{clientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Laura Marcela",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "email": "laura.marcela@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "birthDate": "2000-05-14",
  "emergencyContactName": "Ana Gómez",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "3105551234"
}

### Desactivar un cliente (204 No Content)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{clientId}}/deactivate

### Reactivar un cliente (204 No Content)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{clientId}}/activate

### ───────────── Errores de validación del dominio (400) ─────────────

### Correo con formato inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CitizenshipCard",
  "documentNumber": "12345678",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Ruiz",
  "email": "carlos-sin-arroba",
  "phone": "3001112233",
  "birthDate": "1999-01-01",
  "emergencyContactName": "Pedro Pérez",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "3009998877"
}

### Cliente menor de 14 años
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "IdentityCard",
  "documentNumber": "1012345678",
  "firstName": "Mateo",
  "lastName": "Ruiz",
  "email": "mateo@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001112233",
  "birthDate": "2018-03-01",
  "emergencyContactName": "Pedro Ruiz",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "3009998877"
}

### Teléfono de emergencia igual al del cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CitizenshipCard",
  "documentNumber": "87654321",
  "firstName": "Sara",
  "lastName": "López",
  "email": "sara@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001112233",
  "birthDate": "1995-01-01",
  "emergencyContactName": "Pedro López",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "300-111-2233"
}

### Cédula con letras
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CitizenshipCard",
  "documentNumber": "12AB34",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Ruiz",
  "email": "carlos@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001112233",
  "birthDate": "1999-01-01",
  "emergencyContactName": "Pedro Pérez",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "3009998877"
}

### Desactivar un cliente que ya está inactivo (ejecutar dos veces la desactivación)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{clientId}}/deactivate

### ───────────── Otros errores ─────────────

### Documento ya registrado (409 Conflict) — ejecutar después del primer POST
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CitizenshipCard",
  "documentNumber": "1037654321",
  "firstName": "Otro",
  "lastName": "Cliente",
  "email": "otro@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001112233",
  "birthDate": "1999-01-01",
  "emergencyContactName": "Pedro Pérez",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "3009998877"
}

### Cliente inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
